{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "831b4d3874e99a77d849d318b3e0736250925c0e64ba5552afd05183e8dfb62b", "ja": "あっでもでも、{$P$}さんは\n魔法使いっていうより……。", "zh": "啊，不过不过，\n{$P$}先生与其说是魔法使……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8c2e203ff3f42a8d058e0c91576ce4f5d76c13fdeece943c5fa61b3f2bb0a0de", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\n俺がどうかしましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n我怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "fdc7f0cf7d3fd32dbef7d15936c3237dd157ab7e692fe0243dd569bf218e0e4c", "ja": "あっ、魔法使いの{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，魔法使{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "60dd1bd92d2ac9e13e37ab356f5819c7c1939bc33007610035ddb96dbb874456", "ja": "えっ、魔法使い？", "zh": "咦，魔法使？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "c91cc6e328dd606c2f227fb5c07706e0a4476805581fa9b1d378a7c8ffaa9585", "ja": "えっ？　……きゃっ、{$P$}さん！？\nすみません、私ったら気づかなくて……！", "zh": "呃？……啊，{$P$}先生！？\n不好意思，我也真是的，都没注意到……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "da2c5830373204630e56d09c8a269ce10d9d6b4b724ff20127ad3d75f9395944", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さんのお仕事って\n魔法使いみたいだな～と思ったら、つい……。", "zh": "那个，我刚才在想{$P$}先生的工作\n就像是魔法使～结果不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ab5591831298deffb38002c981a414a53cdb3d507473dd16ecd33576bc436219", "ja": "魔法使い……確かにプロデューサーの仕事は、\nアイドルの夢をファンの人達に届ける事ですけど。", "zh": "魔法使……制作人这份工作，\n确实就是把偶像的梦想传递给粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0c78739f6a375c036dfbd05ae6bddabf3daec6b366509a86804cb565ce1f14a7", "ja": "でも俺より青羽さんが作ってくれる衣装の方が、\nずっと魔法みたいだと思いますよ！", "zh": "但跟我比起来，\n我认为青羽小姐替大家做的服装更像是魔法喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "cb05513f38cbf3ea2fb89c8b2212662b512f311132182cd25086e6a9582f8922", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　嬉しいな～、えへへへへ……\nって、そうだ！", "zh": "是、是吗？好开心喔～嘿嘿嘿嘿……\n啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "f8cf9517de89742fd7e6b271185b964b9e04b702ae2e6f174d37f5bda68f22f5", "ja": "社長さんが、大事なお話があるって呼んでましたよ！\nなんだか、とっても嬉しそうでした。", "zh": "社长说有重要的事要找你喔！\n他看起来非常开心的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "51c95a4500e2eec4e2904771b95f59a2454caefce57f0b1b5eed912a8f971bc4", "ja": "大事な話……もしかして。\nありがとうございます、事務所に行ってみます！", "zh": "重要的事……莫非是──\n谢谢你，我去事务所看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "b45a9fe63f3ca1f1220e271513e5ac156af49e0b486817123ad962024dedbfa6", "ja": "はい、行ってらっしゃ～い♪　……あっ、いけない！\n絵本のこと、伝えるの忘れちゃった！", "zh": "好的，路上小心～♪……啊，糟糕！\n忘记告诉他绘本的事情了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "14ee2e18f1251ca4f8bbe9e9e4c701aa40e48fb63c0cd5de42d11448d8b5ca61", "ja": "鏡よ、鏡よ、鏡さん……かわいいかわいい\n765プロの事務員は、美咲ちゃんと、だぁれ？", "zh": "魔镜啊，魔镜……\n超级可爱的765艺能事务员是美咲跟谁呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "2c6ddd8aa69a8be4ba46ef66ee0e1a6cc8ea43ecf179cf18371fb63440c8667e", "ja": "『もちろん、アナタです。音無小鳥さん』……まぁ！\nなんて正直な鏡さんなのかしら、ウフフッ♪", "zh": "『当然是你，音无小鸟小姐』……哎呀！\n多么老实的魔镜啊，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ef0ff592c62da42458cefa2d48f978eb55d5ffa08e3f6b9fdce465ac94736548", "ja": "お疲れさまです、音無さん。\n……手鏡を見つめて、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，音无小姐。\n……为什么盯着手拿镜呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "5fc66c4f29c1cae46e37f2ee064dc59786618c773df152f39486ab310b782ca6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nちょっとだけ、白雪姫の真似事を……なんて♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我只是在学白雪公主……没什么啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "022338132d40d8f50faf77a4d44427bc4b3611a6cdc17a7eff131f6925288dd1", "ja": "白雪姫？\nあっ！　もしかして、やっぱり……！", "zh": "白雪公主？\n啊！该不会真的是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "09291ade5001e2418487c78932b5a37724d7960f146ab614563c5243df2daa4e", "ja": "おお、君！　来てくれたか！\n音無君は……まだ鏡を見ている最中だったか。", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦！\n音无……还在盯着镜子看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "779ee9fa15bd03d005fadf478dea3accad5e9d8dfff0bdf92707eee309873868", "ja": "君を待っている間におとぎ話について話していたら、\nなんだかスイッチが入ってしまったようでね。", "zh": "刚才等你的期间，我跟她聊到了童话故事，\n结果好像触发她的开关了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "cfb490d1e958e3a79b3938a2cdda56ea91b12966564c5a7c26b9124457691bb3", "ja": "次は……そうだっ、あれを聞いてみようかしら！\n鏡よ、鏡よ、鏡さ～ん……。", "zh": "接下来……对了，问问看那件事吧！\n魔镜啊，魔镜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "a214fb0c1d21fa055d5617969d40e387d3e24df8a54cf94cbf00a7bb6b1697d8", "ja": "音無君はまだ取り込み中のようだが、\n本題に入ろう。", "zh": "音无好像还在忙，\n那我们先进入正题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "311b12b5a7c56d614e98c8f696169e888f87d2f8b61495d66d07c28029d923c0", "ja": "実は、アイドル諸君に受けてもらった、\n例の新作映画のオーディション結果が届いたのだよ！", "zh": "是这样的，偶像们之前参加的那场新电影试镜，\n结果已经送来啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "10d23fec34ce027b3f3536c64ad079c9484df91c3e54087d234e50681777ed22", "ja": "新作映画……というと、\n『おとぎの国の物語』のことでしょうか？", "zh": "新电影……\n你说的是《童话王国的故事》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "46bb23cf46de7842d2adb7475ecf6032852178df5130c9b6eecd881bc85e3b0a", "ja": "うむ！\nそして、我が765プロからは……。", "zh": "没错！\n然后我们765艺能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "73e127da4dd38d17d9a1339e46a23aab3f6dc3c13d95d23bf43588ba182846e9", "ja": "箱崎星梨花君、周防桃子君、徳川まつり君、\n我那覇響君、永吉昴君が、役を射止めた！", "zh": "有箱崎星梨花、周防桃子、德川茉莉、\n我那霸响、永吉昴拿下了角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "59fe3bf70196ae01fa5d3c1194241294f26ef897dd9a40e061c064eddfecb5d7", "ja": "おおっ！　5人も……！", "zh": "哦哦！竟然有五个人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "4ba539576def4f93aac38022b61c36a4edc43986bee12b960e12ad9a1bb520ae", "ja": "今回の作品はおとぎ話の優しい雰囲気に、コメディ\n要素が加わった、とても明るい作品のようだね！", "zh": "这次的作品在童话故事的温馨气氛中，\n加入了喜剧要素，似乎非常阳光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "126002b20ded71b36a0c1fbeff6293f464482cc7eaa1ff8be50f0402b42884ad", "ja": "はい。演じるキャラクターも魅力的で、\nアイドル達にぴったりだと思います！", "zh": "是啊，角色也很有魅力，\n我想一定很适合偶像们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "0f6fb8636b71fe87c2f366ccb212c2de4ed6fd7722bbea2656a48cdeb23bdbf1", "ja": "みんなでおとぎ話の映画……\nなんだかとっても、楽しい作品になりそうですね！", "zh": "大家一起演出童话故事电影……\n感觉会成为非常欢乐的作品呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "8329ea56facd7f6298281375cd2bc944c3b4bb6eff26643e5c897ac1d1a2821f", "ja": "おや、音無君。鏡は、もういいのかね？", "zh": "哎呀，音无，镜子已经照够了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "a66e3e66983c36485f7feda200ba73be525437b26cf588726ced603ccbad7c10", "ja": "えっ？\n鏡……社長、それって何のことですか？", "zh": "咦？\n镜子……社长，你这话是什么意思呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "71857c2cbeb756bde9a67f1d7233afb7364c6aab4c48f53553899726dec1e2fa", "ja": "えっ……あれ？　さっきまで、\n鏡と話をしていたんじゃ……。", "zh": "呃……咦？\n你刚才不是一直在跟镜子说话吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "682a9eca90cf6f314d4796234160692641c7acc620aff48794cae9732f789e31", "ja": "まぁ、{$P$}さんったら！　それじゃ\nまるで、私が白雪姫みたいじゃありませんか♪", "zh": "哎唷，{$P$}先生真是的！\n你这样说，我岂不成了白雪公主吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "518ba9839e1e8fb98966882382a8949531b6444fcf84c0f81d55a95d1457d857", "ja": "うーむ……もしかしたら音無君も我々も、\nひと時の魔法にかかっていたのかもしれないね。", "zh": "嗯……也许音无和我们，\n刚才都被施了暂时性的魔法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "f84022d9987f7f48cecce18e7287d66f60b52f80977acb0663603bed408c945e", "ja": "撮影は、すぐにも始まるようだ。どうか君の力で、\n映画を成功に導いてくれたまえ。よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "听说很快就会开拍。\n用你的力量引导电影迈向成功吧，拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8d569ca495cc99364668ca54c5a445e6c7fb0e68a662a2621862e072c8f0d792", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　アイドルみんなと一緒に、\n必ずこの映画を成功させてみせます！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！\n我绝对会和偶像们一起让这部电影圆满成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0102_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "2ad732242fe8ac9e88f1db461ea9a7a84e038af0fd00f4c69cfef6201e3637da", "ja": "（『おとぎの国の物語』、早速みんなにも\n知らせないとな……さぁ、忙しくなりそうだ！）", "zh": "（得尽快把《童话王国的故事》的消息告诉大家……\n好，感觉要忙碌起来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
